&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Principal Software Engineer, Mobile is SharkNinja&#39;s deepest technical authority on mobile engineering — the person others come to when the patterns don&#39;t exist yet. You&#39;ll define the architectural standards and engineering principles that shape mobile across SharkNinja&#39;s connected product ecosystem, including SharkClean, NinjaPro Connect, and the next-generation unified app platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll tackle the most complex technical challenges at the intersection of mobile, firmware, cloud, AI, and consumer experience — exercising independent judgment on high-stakes, ambiguous decisions with long-term implications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an IC role. Your authority comes from expertise and trust, not headcount.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solve the Hardest Technical Problems&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own SharkNinja&#39;s most complex, non-recurring mobile challenges — spanning native iOS/Android, cross-platform frameworks, cloud integration, device connectivity, and AI-driven development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make and defend high-stakes architecture and technology decisions with long-term impact on platform reliability and engineering velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Define Technical Standards and Architecture&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and evolve mobile engineering standards — architecture patterns, cross-platform strategy, testing philosophy, and production-readiness criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define integration patterns across mobile, cloud, firmware, and connected devices, and drive React Native vs. native platform strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and AI coding tools, forming clear technical points of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead Technical Thought Leadership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as SharkNinja&#39;s go-to authority on mobile engineering across Mobile, Firmware, Cloud, Hardware, Product, and Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design reviews and communities of practice that raise engineering quality org-wide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Elevate Engineering Capability&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior and staff engineers through proximity to hard problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable frameworks, reference architectures, and documentation that outlast any single project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI-driven development workflows across the mobile org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Advance AI-Ready Mobile Architecture&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how the mobile platform integrates with AI — on-device inference, AI-powered features, and data contracts connecting mobile to cloud-based AI services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve mobile/AI integration challenges with no established playbook, ensuring the platform is built for the AI-powered features SharkNinja will ship next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive software engineering experience, with deep expertise in native iOS (Swift), Android (Kotlin), and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of solving the hardest mobile engineering problems — architecture, cross-platform unification, consumer-scale reliability — with measurable impact at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in mobile-to-cloud integration, BLE/Wi-Fi connectivity, and the full stack from firmware interfaces through cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized technical authority, sought out when the stakes are highest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to set engineering standards and frameworks that scale across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional influence built on technical credibility, not positional authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, translating complex decisions for leadership and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred:&lt;/em&gt; Rust/C/C++ for cross-platform or performance-critical work; connected product/IoT/robotics/smart home background; AI-integrated mobile architecture experience (on-device ML, AI-assisted dev, LLM interfaces); experience with platform unification or large-scale architectural transitions; consumer electronics or robotics background.&lt;/p&gt;
